{"title": "Astral Knowledge", "pageid": 6593, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Astral_Knowledge", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Astral_Knowledge.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Astral_Knowledge.webp/300px-Astral_Knowledge.webp, /w/images/d/d3/Astral_Knowledge.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Astral_Knowledge.webp/300px-Astral_Knowledge.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Astral_Knowledge.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Astral Knowledge</b> is a class action for <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">Githyanki</a>. It grants them the ability to temporarily gain Proficiency in an Ability Score's skills.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nGain <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> in all <a href=\"/wiki/Skills\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a> of a chosen <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Scores\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Scores\">Ability</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\